            "created_at": "2025-08-26T23:53:56.148682+00:00",
            "notes": "TTT and MoTK are the important items, the rest fill to your budget focusing on power.\n\n*Update* If you feel you have enough damage, I've actually started running a new setup once I've hit the 65,500 mark of $$. This is for those of you who read all the notes ;)\n\nTTT, MoTK, Iridescent Iris, Champion's Kit, Vanadium Injection, Martian Mender.\n\nWhat that gives you is 30% CD, which knocks your Rockets down to about 4sec cooldown. Our overhealth from rockets last 3sec. Giving us only a 1sec downtime as long as we are hitting rockets. We do lose out on some raw damage, but I still find that there is enough damage there to oneshot nearly everyone with rockets+gun but if they block or survive the damage you have a very fast follow-up with more rockets.\n\nThe faster refresh on our tank + martian mender gives a very good amount of survivability I feel. You don't want to use your ult anymore once you have Vanadium. Infact I've actually changed the keybind for it on Solider so I don't accidently press it. I only recommend doing this if you are confident in your ability to kill targets without it.",
